{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣淨慈暉，會元無出，今收入補燈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語見雲外\n章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即南宋光宗紹熈四年也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即南宋淳祐三年也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖派圖以師嗣清遠渭者，非是。盖錯以報國謙為靈\n谷謙也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣育王光會元無出今收入補燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣育王光會元無出今收入補燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣育王光會元無出今收入補燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣育王光會，元無出，今收入補燈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱祖鑒，續傳燈誤作宗鑒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣淨慈一會元無出今收入補燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣焦山體會，元無出，今收入補燈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣大洪，證會元無出，今收入補燈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣竹林安，安嗣竹林寶，寶嗣懶牛和，和嗣天目齊，\n\n齊嗣五祖演。自齊以下會元俱無出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語見中和章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鼻蛇"}
